3.Second  150 Second Disapprove  3
4.Second  570 Second Disapprove  4
> ## fit the model
> summary(fit1 <- glmer(Approval ~ survey + (1 | id), family = binomial,
+                       data = approval.long, weights = Freq, nAGQ = 5))
