On 05/26/2011 12:50 PM, Jens Oldeland wrote:
> Dear Mixed-Model SIG
> 
> I am trying to use serial and spatial correlation structures in a gamm
> model.
> 
> g2 <- gamm(sqrt(pp10M.day) ~
>          s(tempsurf, bs="cr"),
