>>  print(Om1  <-  lmer(yield  ~  nitro  +  Variety  +  (1  | 
> Block/Variety),
> + Oats),  corr  =  FALSE)
> 
> Source: cran.r-project.org/web/packages/
> <http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/>*lme4*/vignettes/Implementation.pdf
> 
> I'm confused by your comment.
> 
