>>>> Fix + (1 | Rand) + (1 | Rand : Fix)
>>> Which one is the null hypothesis:
>>>
>>>> 1 + (1 | Rand)
>>> or
>>>
>>>> 1 + (1 | Rand) + (1 | Rand : Fix)
>>> To me the interaction term (1 | Rand : Fix) does not make much sense if
>>> no fixed effect term is present in the model, but I'm not sure.
