From A.Robinson at ms.unimelb.edu.au  Mon Apr 11 07:19:26 2011
From: A.Robinson at ms.unimelb.edu.au (Andrew Robinson)
Date: Mon, 11 Apr 2011 15:19:26 +1000
Subject: [R-sig-ME] nlme book
