  + start.t + startSQ + sea + tidem + tided, data = SUSCforage, random = ~1|scoterID,
  correlation = corCompSymm(form = ~1|scoterID), method = "REML")

So, if I want to obtain an accurate AIC value, which should I use?

thank you,

